# Official ServiceNow documentation the SAOS knowledge corpus is built from.
# Rebuild the corpus on any machine with:
#   node scripts/ingest-servicenow-docs.mjs --file scripts/servicenow-docs.urls
# Every URL is rendered through the fetcher (src/knowledge/fetch-docs.js), never reconstructed;
# a page that does not render is refused and named. The corpus directory (data/knowledge) is not
# in git, so this list is the record of what the corpus contains. Three URLs in the original set
# did not render on 2026-09-21 and are listed at the bottom, commented out, so the gap is visible.

